flowchart LR
  A[Public UCI archive] --> B[Source hash + data audit]
  B --> C{Source stable flag}
  C -->|non-static| D[Retain / do not use for stable-state diagnosis]
  C -->|stable| E[Cycle feature extraction]
  E --> F[Matched factorial analysis]
  F --> G[Discovery split]
  F --> H[Verification split]
  G --> I[Signal candidates]
  H --> J[Repeatability check]
  I --> J
  J --> K{Specific enough?}
  K -->|yes: cooler / valve| L[Candidate targeted branch]
  K -->|no: pump / accumulator| M[Require multi-signal / physical confirmation]
  L --> N[Proposal-only troubleshooting workflow]
  M --> N
  N --> O[Independent validation experiment — planned]
